### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# The whole directory: it holds machine-specific paths and JDK names, so sharing
# it causes more friction than it saves. The Maven wrapper is what makes the
# project reproducible, not the IDE settings.
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

